am*","createdAt":"2026-04-07T11:59:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4198784296","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M769mU7","author":{"login":"zhaog100"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-08T23:44:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4210451771","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M77E7ys","author":{"login":"ledgerpilot"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nImplementing a complete Claude Code PR review agent with:\n- CLI interface: `claude-review --pr <url>`\n- Structured Markdown output (summary, risks, suggestions, confidence score)\n- GitHub Actions workflow option\n- Sample outputs on 2 real PRs\n- Full README with setup instructions","createdAt":"2026-04-09T07:32:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4212374700","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M77GnVA","author":{"login":"davidweb3-ctrl"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-09T08:41:53Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4212815168","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M77TzqN","author":{"login":"ElromEvedElElyon"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"C:/Program Files/Git/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-09T17:42:40Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4216273549","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M77Ua5Y","author":{"login":"borjamoskv"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-04-09T18:11:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4216434264","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M77vNZc","author":{"login":"bobbiejaxn"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nBuilding a zero-dependency CLI + GitHub Action PR reviewer with structured Markdown output, tested on 2 real PRs. PR: #1 (from bobbiejaxn fork)","createdAt":"2026-04-10T11:32:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4223456860","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M78Kh7E","author":{"login":"lui62233"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## /opire try\n\nClaiming **Bounty #4** () — Claude Code PR reviewer agent.\n\n**Submission**: PR #543 — https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/543\n\n### Deliverable\n\nComplete Claude Code PR reviewer agent:\n\n- claude-review.py — Full CLI tool with Python implementation\n- .github/workflows/pr-review.yml — GitHub Action for automatic PR reviews\n- README.md — Complete documentation\n\n### Features\n\n- Works via CLI: claude-review.py --pr https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/123\n- GitHub Action: Runs automatically on PR events\n- Structured Markdown: Summary, Risks, Suggestions, Confidence Score\n- Posts directly to GitHub PR comments\n\n### Acceptance Criteria\n\n| Criterion | Status |\n|-----------|--------|\n| CLI | Done |\n| GitHub Action | Done |\n| Structured Markdown output | Done |\n| Summary 2-3 sentences | Done |\n| Risks list | Done |\n| Suggestions list | Done |\n| Confidence score | Done |\n| README | Done |\n\nPayment: lui62233","createdAt":"2026-0