28Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4338788887","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABA6z6Bg","author":{"login":"dockfixlabs"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nBuilding the PR review sub-agent in Python (stdlib only — no pip install).\nIt: fetches PR metadata + diff via GitHub API, calls claude-sonnet-4-20250514\nwith a structured review prompt, and posts the review as a GitHub comment.\nOutput includes: Summary, Strengths, Issues (with severity/file/line), Testing,\nand a clear Approve/Request Changes/Comment verdict.\n\nPR incoming shortly.","createdAt":"2026-04-30T22:38:38Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4356635142","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABA8JfQw","author":{"login":"wbobbynmworley"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nI am interested in working on this task.","createdAt":"2026-05-01T05:48:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4358037315","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABA8MfQg","author":{"login":"wbobbynmworley"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"PR submitted: [#725](https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/725) - includes Python CLI agent + GitHub Action + 2 sample outputs. Ready for review.","createdAt":"2026-05-01T06:05:55Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4358086466","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABA8bB4Q","author":{"login":"wbobbynmworley"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Our PR is ready: [PR #725](https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/725)\n\n**Why our solution stands out:**\n\n- Python CLI: `python claude_review.py --pr https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/123`\n- OR GitHub Action YAML for fully automated PR review on every pull_request event\n- Structured output: Summary, Risks (with severity), Improvement Suggestions, Confidence Score\n- Uses Claude Sonnet API with configurable model\n- 2 sample review outputs included in SAMPLE_OUTPUT.md\n- README with full setup instructions\n","createdAt":"2026-05-01T07:26:47Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4358324705","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABBBElnw","author":{"login":"yihangwu539-png"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire claim\n\nPR: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/689","createdAt":"2026-05-02T06:43:22Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4363199903","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABBBGD8A","author":{"login":"vantaq-labs"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-02T06:52:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4363224048","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABBPzwZA","author":{"login":"chengyixu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-05T11:06:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#is