-agent that:\n\n- **Triggers on new PR webhooks**: Automatically checks out the PR branch\n- **Analyzes code changes**: Runs structured review (security, logic, style, tests)\n- **Posts structured comments**: Nested GitHub comment with severity-categorized findings (?? Critical / ?? Warning / ? Suggestion)\n- **Configure via standard Claude Code skill**: Designed as a reusable .claude/skills/ skill file\n- **Includes comprehensive tests**: Self-contained test suite against sample PRs\n\n**Timeline**: 24 hours from assignment.\n**Why me**: I build Claude Code sub-agents/skills daily. I know the hook system inside-out.\n\n\"/opire try\" to claim.","createdAt":"2026-05-11T18:15:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4423515487","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABB68RIQ","author":{"login":"mt211211"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nSubmitting a focused PR review agent: a dependency-light CLI that fetches a PR diff, produces structured Markdown with summary, risks, suggestions, and confidence, plus a GitHub Action workflow, tests, and sample outputs from real public PRs. No payment details will be posted publicly.","createdAt":"2026-05-11T18:58:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4423880993","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABB6_fxQ","author":{"login":"mt211211"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"PR submitted for this bounty: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/962","createdAt":"2026-05-11T19:03:32Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4423933893","