tputs, tests, and `--comment` mode that posts the generated review back to the PR when `GITHUB_TOKEN` is provided.\n- Verification: `python3 -m unittest discover agents/claude-pr-review/tests`, `python3 -m py_compile agents/claude-pr-review/claude_review.py`, live sample review generation against PR #1309, missing-token `--comment` guard check, and `git diff --check` all passed.\n\nThis keeps my claim consolidated in #1310; I am not opening duplicate PRs for this bounty.","createdAt":"2026-05-15T14:58:56Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4460865110","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCeRnMQ","author":{"login":"ZLNiao"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Update: I also have a Payoneer account (939972165@qq.com) with US receiving details if Stripe is required. Either way works!","createdAt":"2026-05-15T15:07:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4460930865","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCefdwQ","author":{"login":"cycy701"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-15T15:37:58Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4461157825","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCemlJg","author":{"login":"zp6"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming this bounty! PR submitted: #1421\n\nWallet: zp6","createdAt":"2026-05-15T15:55:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4461274406","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCewNcQ","author":{"login":"AngelITStudio"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nSubmitted clean Angel IT Studio PR #1425 for this $150 bounty: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/1425\n\nIt adds `claude-review`, a CLI that accepts a GitHub PR URL and returns a structured Markdown review with summary, risks, suggestions, and confidence score. It includes README usage docs, a smoke test, and sample outputs from two real PRs (#1374 and #1381).","createdAt":"2026-05-15T16:18:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4461432177","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABCfSokQ","author":{"login":"cycy701"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-15T17:49:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4461996177","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABChCrnA","author":{"login":"Qwe1122333"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nPR submitted: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/1429\n\nFeatures:\n- CLI-first: `python3 claude-review.py --pr <url>`\n- Dual analysis: rule-based (instant) + Claude API (optional)\n- Structured Markdown with confidence score\n- GitHub Action included (auto-reviews on PR open/sync)\n- `--post` flag to publish review as PR comment\n- JSON output for programmatic use\n- Tested on 2 real PRs (sample outputs included)\n- Zero dependencies (Python 3.8+ stdlib)\n\nLooking forward to feedback!","createdAt":"2026-05-15T21:38:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4463831964","viewe