ctionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4527490766","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDd_ngQ","author":{"login":"pterking"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## ✅ Delivery Submitted — [@pterking](https://github.com/pterking)\n\n### 📦 PR Reviewer Agent — Analyze PR Diffs & Post Structured Reviews\n\n**PR:** [#2048](https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2048)\n\n**Files:**\n- `deliverables/pr-reviewer-agent/claude-review.py` (CLI tool, 13.9 KB)\n- `deliverables/pr-reviewer-agent/pr-reviewer-action.yml` (GitHub Action, 1.3 KB)\n- `deliverables/pr-reviewer-agent/README.md` (Docs, 5.0 KB)\n\n### CLI Usage\n\n```bash\nclaude-review --pr https://github.com/owner/repo/pull/123\nclaude-review --diff < changes.patch\nclaude-review --demo\n```\n\n### 25+ Risk Patterns — 5 Categories\n\n| Category | Count | Examples |\n|----------|-------|----------|\n| 🔒 Security | 10 | eval, SQL injection, XSS, hardcoded secrets |\n| 📐 Code Quality | 8 | TODO, var, loose equality, debugger |\n| ⚡ Performance | 4 | for...in, unnecessary slice(0) |\n| 🐛 Potential Bugs | 4 | if(true), empty catch, redundant && true |\n| ✅ Test Detection | 5 | it(), @pytest.fixture, Go Test* |\n\n### Test Results — Real GitHub PRs\n\n| PR | Files | Lines | Risks | Confidence |\n|----|-------|-------|-------|------------|\n| psf/requests#6500 | 1 | 1+1 | 0 | 🟢 High |\n| psf/requests#6400 | 3 | 35+ | 0 | 🟢 High |\n| Demo | 1 | 25+ | 3 | 🔴 Low |\n\n---\n🤖 Delivered by **Atlas Bounty Hunter**\n","createdAt":"2026-05-24T07:41:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4527744897","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDeChVA","author":{"login":"dagangtj"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-24T08:05:02Z","includesC