kdown review. I will also provide a GitHub Action workflow YAML that runs the tool on `pull_request` events and posts the comment back to the PR automatically.\n\n## Deliverables\n- **CLI tool**: `claude-review --pr <url>` with structured output (Summary, Risks, Suggestions, Confidence score)\n- **GitHub Action**: Workflow YAML for automated PR reviews on events\n- **Test outputs**: Reviews from 2 real GitHub PRs included in the submission\n- **README**: Setup, configuration (GitHub token, API key), and usage instructions\n\n## ETA\n3–4 days\n\n## Payout Address\n`0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658`","createdAt":"2026-05-25T11:56:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4534057773","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDkFzjg","author":{"login":"zhaog100"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-25T12:09:14Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4534137742","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDk3sDw","author":{"login":"sureshchouksey8"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-25T14:18:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4534955023","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDlfofw","author":{"login":"tiago918"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\nWorking on the Claude PR reviewer agent. PR incoming.","createdAt":"2026-05-25T16:08:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4535609471","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDlhtIw","author":{"login":"tiago918"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/try","createdAt":"2026-05-25T16:14:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4535643427","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDmuSRg","author":{"login":"VexCode24"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-25T20:05:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4536898118","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDsdpFg","author":{"login":"ybbuge2537"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T09:36:51Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4542916886","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtcL-A","author":{"login":"Thanhdn1984"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T12:02:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4543941624","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtmkPg","author":{"login":"totoxu"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming this $150 bounty. My PR #1911 includes a Claude Code sub-agent that reviews PRs and posts structured comments (built with Claude Code agent + GitHub API). Ready for review.\n\n**Payment Address:** RTC wallet pending","createdAt":"2026-05-26T12:44:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4544111678","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDtsmog","author":{"login":"matengtian"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T13:00:04Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4544210594","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABDyToEQ","author":{"login":"dagangtj"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-26T21:23:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4549044241","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD0c4Cw","author":{"login":"Hobie1Kenobi"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I'd like to take this on. The core deliverable is straightforward: a CLI tool (`claude-review`) that fetches a PR diff via the GitHub API, sends it to Claude for structured analysis, and outputs Markdown with summary, risks, suggestions, and confidence score. I'll also include a GitHub Action workflow YAML so it can run automatically on PR events.\n\nMy plan: TypeScript/Node.js CLI using Commander.js and Octokit to fetch the diff, then pipe it to the Anthropic API with a carefully crafted system prompt that enforces the structured output format. I'll handle edge cases like large diffs (pagination/truncation), private repos (token auth), and rate limits. The GitHub Action will use `actions/github-script` or a custom action wrapping the CLI.\n\nI'll test on two real public PRs and include their full outputs in the PR. README will cover CLI install, GitHub Action setup, required env vars, and configuration options.\n\nETA: 3–4 days.\n\nPayout (Base): 0x408f39B19266022FeC03076091e59D1f4f163658","createdAt":"2026-05-27T04:29:25Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4551292939","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD56apA","author":{"login":"CHY9213"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-27T17:36:29Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4557019812","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD6GDfw","author":{"login":"CHY9213"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-27T17:59:59Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4557210495","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD6PY7Q","author":{"login":"CHY9213"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR for this bounty: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2163\n\nIncludes the `claude-review --pr <url>` CLI, structured Markdown output, two real PR sample outputs, README, composite action metadata, and unit tests.","createdAt":"2026-05-27T18:18:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4557363437","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD6WkgQ","author":{"login":"wbo68410-lgtm"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-27T18:31:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4557481089","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABD6cKfw","author":{"login":"jasanpe"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try\n\n