aft\n- PR #2281 is CLEAN/mergeable\n- PR body closes #4\n- Includes `claude-review --pr <url>` CLI, Claude Code sub-agent instructions, idempotent GitHub Action, tests, README docs, and two real public PR sample outputs\n- Validation completed: `npm run check`, fixture run, two live PR sample generations, and `git diff --check`\n\nNo contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:05:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4578305840","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABEOZTXw","author":{"login":"sujaysun101"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:20:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4578497375","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABEObNgg","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Status refresh after the newer same-issue #4 `/opire try` from @sujaysun101.\n\nMy active #4 submission remains PR #2281: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2281\n\nCurrent status verified now:\n- PR #2281 is open and non-draft\n- PR #2281 is CLEAN/mergeable\n- PR body closes #4\n- Includes `claude-review --pr <url>` CLI, Claude Code sub-agent instructions, idempotent GitHub Action, tests, README docs, and two real public PR sample outputs\n- Validation completed: `npm run check`, fixture run, two live PR sample generations, and `git diff --check`\n\nNo contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:23:44Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4578528642","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABEOi0Uw","author":{"login":"fennhelloworld"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Bounty Submission: AI PR Review Agent\n\nCloses #4\n\nI've built a fully working AI-powered PR review agent:\n\nRepo: https://github.com/fennhelloworld/claude-pr-reviewer\n\n### Acceptance Criteria Met\n- CLI: node cli.js --pr URL\n- GitHub Action: .github/workflows/pr-review.yml included\n- Structured Markdown output with Summary, Risks, Suggestions, Confidence score\n- Tested on 2 real PRs (facebook/react#36562 and denoland/deno#34533)\n- README with full setup and usage instructions\n\n### Key Features\n- Supports full URLs and shorthand (owner/repo/123)\n- --output to save review, --post to comment on PR\n- Works with any OpenAI-compatible LLM endpoint\n- Fallback from gh CLI to curl for diff fetching","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:39:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4578653267","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABEOpDKA","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Status refresh after newer same-issue #4 activity, including the external repository submission from @fennhelloworld.\n\nMy active #4 submission remains PR #2281: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2281\n\nCurrent status verified now:\n- PR #2281 is open and non-draft\n- PR #2281 is CLEAN/mergeable\n- PR body closes #4\n- Includes claude-review --pr <url> CLI, Claude Code sub-agent instructions, idempotent GitHub Action, tests, README docs, and two real public PR sample outputs\n- Validation remains listed in the PR body\n\nNo contributor-side changes are pending unless maintainers request revisions.","createdAt":"2026-05-29T18:49:30Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reac