式：`claude-review --pr <url>`\n   - GitHub Action 模式：`.github/workflows/review.yml`\n✅ **结构化 Markdown 输出**（4 段：summary / risks / suggestions / confidence score）\n✅ **2 个真 PR 测试输出**（sample outputs section）\n✅ **TypeScript**（强类型，可维护）\n✅ **13 个 commits**（含 .gitignore、package.json、tsconfig.json、CI workflow）\n\n**差异化（vs 现有 PR）：**\n- **本地 + 云端双 LLM 支持**：默认 Claude Sonnet 4（高质），可切 MiniMax Text-01（90× 便宜，PoC 验证用）\n- **Risk 维度更多**：除 code review 标准 5 维度，加\"安全/性能/可维护性\"3 维\n- **Confidence score 校准**：基于 review 实际命中数，**不拍脑袋**\n\n**24h 响应承诺：** 任何 review comment 24h 内必响应。","createdAt":"2026-06-02T15:46:43Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4604138458","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABEm7uwQ","author":{"login":"zeroknowledge0x"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/opire try","createdAt":"2026-06-02T15:57:15Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4604227265","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDORx6c0M8AAAABEm8H1A","author":{"login":"taherdhanera"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Visibility refresh after newer same-issue #4 `/claim` activity from @phoenix7956:\n- Latest claim comment: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/issues/4#issuecomment-4604138458\n- PR #2027: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2027\n\nMy active #4 submission remains PR #2281: https://github.com/claude-builders-bounty/claude-builders-bounty/pull/2281\n\nCurrent status re-verified now:\n- PR #2281 is open and non-draft\n- PR #2281 is CLEAN/mergeable\n- PR body closes #4\n- No checks are configured on this branch\n- Scope remains complete for the bounty: dependency-free Node `claude-review --pr <url>` CLI, Claude Code sub-agent instructions